WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.669
I told Felix that I couldn't talk because I was going to cry.

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:04.629
And, oh, I really am going to cry.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:13.680
I know many of you came with your parents, with your family.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:21.521
Because, well, you are like family to, man, millions of people.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:26.776
So I understand how all of you feel because I feel the same way.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:31.448
I'm thinking about the pride for my family in this moment, having you here.

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:34.159
So thank you so much for coming.

00:00:36.618 --> 00:00:40.789
So, I'm sorry, but it's a really big honor for us.

00:00:41.123 --> 00:00:43.292
Please. Los Tigres del Norte.

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:48.839
Thank you. Thank you,

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:53.969
thank you, thank you.

00:01:01.476 --> 00:01:11.361
They've already yelled at me a thousand times to go back to my land because I don't belong here.

00:01:16.199 --> 00:01:19.328
I want to remind the gringo.

00:01:19.494 --> 00:01:22.623
I didn't cross the border.

00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:25.834
The border crossed me.

00:01:26.293 --> 00:01:32.507
America was born free. Men divided it.

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:45.020
They drew the line, so I would jump it.

00:01:45.395 --> 00:01:49.524
And they call me an invader.

00:01:53.445 --> 00:02:00.077
It's a glaring mistake. They took eight states from us.

00:02:00.118 --> 00:02:03.080
Who is the invader here?

00:02:03.455 --> 00:02:08.877
I'm a foreigner in my own land and I'm not here to wage war.

00:02:08.919 --> 00:02:12.964
I am a hardworking man.

00:02:18.303 --> 00:02:28.438
And if history does not lie, here the powerful nation sat in glory.

00:02:36.321 --> 00:02:46.039
Among brave warriors, native people of two continents mixed with Spanish blood.

00:02:46.331 --> 00:02:49.459
And if we go back through the centuries.

00:02:49.501 --> 00:02:54.047
We are more American.

00:02:54.089 --> 00:03:02.097
We are more American than the son of an Anglo-Saxon.

00:03:05.976 --> 00:03:09.813
They bought the waters of the Rio Grande from us without paying a dime.

00:03:10.564 --> 00:03:14.901
And they took Texas, New Mexico, Arizona and Colorado from us.

00:03:15.777 --> 00:03:18.697
California and Nevada went, too.

00:03:19.322 --> 00:03:21.324
Even Utah wasn't enough for them.

00:03:21.616 --> 00:03:24.911
They also took the state of Wyoming from us.

00:03:25.871 --> 00:03:27.998
I am Indigenous blood.

00:03:27.998 --> 00:03:29.958
I am Latino. I am mestizo.

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:33.420
We are of all colors and of all trades.

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:37.799
And even if it hurts the neighbor, we are more American.

00:03:38.008 --> 00:03:43.013
We are more American than every single gringo.

00:03:45.932 --> 00:03:49.186
And if history does not lie.

00:03:49.352 --> 00:03:55.650
Here the powerful nation sat in glory.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:13.376
